<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania Jan-Nov 1996 trade deficit rises.</title>
<headline>Lithuania Jan-Nov 1996 trade deficit rises.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's trade deficit rose in real prices to 3.77 billion litas in January-November 1996 from 3.279 billion in January to October, the statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p>LITHUANIAN TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>			Jan-Nov '96	Jan-Oct '96    Jan-Nov '95</p>
<p>   Exports	   11.926		10.705	   9.783</p>
<p>   Imports	   15.698		13.984	   13.074</p>
<p>   Deficit	    3.772		 3.279	    3.291</p>
<p>Note -- All figures are in billions of litas</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
